# Necromancer ranks, the Rite, the Church's Sense, the Holy Hunt and the licence (WP-N3: necro/necro.js, necro/commands.js,
# design/data/necro.toml [points] [entry] [rite] [[rank]] [church] [hunt] [licence]). `ttl necro expect`, `ttl rep expect`
# and `ttl roads expect` print "ttl: ..." when wrong, which `server.sh test-all` counts as a failure.
# A walks the Rite and the whole ladder; B enters by a master's spell (create_greater_undead), C by race (ghoul).
# Expect in the log: "[ttl] necro: TtlBotRankA performed the Rite", "... rank 3 -> 4 (Overlord)", "... is Marked",
# "the Holy Hunt is on TtlBotRankA", "... survived the Hunt", "... is a Licensed Exorcist", "... licence revoked",
# "TtlBotRankB became a necromancer by skill", "TtlBotRankC became a necromancer by race".
# Verify in game (first run): `spells 1` after `tensura edit ability grant` (mastery >= 0 for a granted magic), the race
# read after `tensura edit race`, the stub holy_hunt firing through the director.
ttlbot spawn TtlBotRankA
ttlbot spawn TtlBotRankB
ttlbot spawn TtlBotRankC
@sleep 3
ttl reset TtlBotRankA
ttl reset TtlBotRankB
ttl reset TtlBotRankC
@sleep 3
ttl necro test TtlBotRankA reset
ttl necro test TtlBotRankB reset
ttl necro test TtlBotRankC reset
ttl necro legion test TtlBotRankA reset
ttl roads test TtlBotRankA reset
# Life 1: no rite.
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA try_rite life2only
ttl roads test TtlBotRankA life2
ttl roads test TtlBotRankB life2
ttl roads test TtlBotRankC life2
ttl necro test TtlBotRankA continent 1
gamemode creative TtlBotRankA
gamemode creative TtlBotRankB
gamemode creative TtlBotRankC
execute in minecraft:overworld run forceload add 4590 4590 4620 4610
execute in minecraft:overworld run fill 4590 150 4590 4620 150 4610 minecraft:stone
execute in minecraft:overworld run fill 4590 151 4590 4620 156 4610 minecraft:air
execute in minecraft:overworld run setblock 4600 151 4600 ttl:bone_altar
execute in minecraft:overworld run tp TtlBotRankA 4602 151 4600
execute in minecraft:overworld run tp TtlBotRankB 4610 151 4604
execute in minecraft:overworld run tp TtlBotRankC 4614 151 4604
@sleep 1
# 1. The Rite: an altar of one's own, a spell of the dead, then the reagent.
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA rank 0
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA entry none
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA try_rite noaltar
ttl necro legion altar TtlBotRankA 4600 151 4600
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA try_rite nospell
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA aspirant no
tensura edit ability grant TtlBotRankA tensura:create_lesser_undead
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA spells 1
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA aspirant yes
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA entry none
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA try_rite noreagent
give TtlBotRankA ttl:soul_ash 10
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA try_rite ok
execute as TtlBotRankA run ttl necro rite
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA rank 1
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA entry rite
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA title Gravebinder
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA stage_rank1 yes
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA stage_rank2 no
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA try_rite already
ttl necro legion expect TtlBotRankA ash 0
ttl necro legion expect TtlBotRankA rank 1
# 2. Points and the weekly cap (60).
ttl necro test TtlBotRankA week
ttl necro points TtlBotRankA add 70
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA points 60
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA week 60
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA rank 2
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA title Bonecaller
ttl necro points TtlBotRankA add 5
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA points 60
ttl necro points TtlBotRankA set 120
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA rank 3
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA stage_rank3 yes
# 3. Overlord: 400 points AND Wight King, Vampire or Mortal Fear.
ttl necro points TtlBotRankA set 400
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA rank4req no
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA rank 3
tensura edit race TtlBotRankA set tensura:wight_king
@sleep 1
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA race tensura:wight_king
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA rank4req yes
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA rank 4
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA title Overlord
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA stage_rank4 yes
ttl necro legion expect TtlBotRankA rank 4
ttl necro legion expect TtlBotRankA cap 8
ttl rep expect TtlBotRankA renown stages 10
# 4. The Church's Sense: a dark road adds it (roads.toml extra.sense), Marked at 20, Hunt at 50.
ttl rep set TtlBotRankA holy_church 0
ttl rep set TtlBotRankA outcast 0
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA sense 0
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA eye unnoticed
ttl roads pay TtlBotRankA necro raise dark
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA sense 3
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA marked no
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA wildmult_hinata_sakaguchi 1
ttl necro sense TtlBotRankA set 20
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA marked yes
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA stage_marked yes
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA bounty yes
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA wildmult_hinata_sakaguchi 3
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA wildmult_shizu 1
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA guards_holy_church yes
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA hunted no
ttl rep expect TtlBotRankA holy_church value -13
ttl necro sense TtlBotRankA set 50
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA hunted yes
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA stage_hunted yes
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA wildmult_hinata_sakaguchi 5
ttl rep expect TtlBotRankA holy_church value -23
# 5. Outlast the Hunt: 120 online minutes → Unbroken, outcast +15.
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA unbroken no
ttl necro test TtlBotRankA huntmins 120
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA unbroken yes
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA stage_title.unbroken yes
ttl rep expect TtlBotRankA outcast value 15
ttl necro hunt TtlBotRankA end
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA hunted no
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA hunts 1
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA wildmult_hinata_sakaguchi 3
# 6. The licence: zero Sense for 14 days, Honored, in the Church's lands.
ttl necro sense TtlBotRankA set 0
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA marked no
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA bounty no
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA guards_holy_church no
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA try_licence clean
ttl necro test TtlBotRankA clean 14
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA try_licence band
ttl rep set TtlBotRankA holy_church 60
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA try_licence place
ttl necro test TtlBotRankA place 1
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA try_licence ok
execute as TtlBotRankA run ttl necro licence
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA licensed yes
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA stage_licensed yes
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA licence_item 1
ttl rep expect TtlBotRankA holy_church value 65
# 7. A single dark act revokes it: the route's -3, the revocation's -20, the paper is taken.
ttl roads pay TtlBotRankA necro raise dark
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA licensed no
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA licence_item 0
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA sense 3
ttl rep expect TtlBotRankA holy_church value 42
# 8. Outside the canon continent the Church senses nothing (R11).
ttl necro test TtlBotRankA continent 2
ttl necro sense TtlBotRankA set 0
ttl roads pay TtlBotRankA necro raise dark
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA sense 0
ttl necro test TtlBotRankA continent 0
# 9. The other ways in: a master's spell (B), a race of the dead (C).
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankB entry none
tensura edit ability grant TtlBotRankB tensura:create_greater_undead
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankB entry skill
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankB rank 1
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankC entry none
tensura edit race TtlBotRankC set tensura:ghoul
@sleep 1
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankC entry race
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankC rank 1
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankC rank4req no
# Clean up.
ttl necro test TtlBotRankA reset
ttl necro test TtlBotRankB reset
ttl necro test TtlBotRankC reset
ttl necro legion test TtlBotRankA reset
ttl roads test TtlBotRankA reset
ttl roads test TtlBotRankB reset
ttl roads test TtlBotRankC reset
tensura edit ability revoke TtlBotRankA tensura:create_lesser_undead
tensura edit ability revoke TtlBotRankB tensura:create_greater_undead
execute in minecraft:overworld run fill 4590 151 4590 4620 156 4610 minecraft:air
execute in minecraft:overworld run forceload remove 4590 4590 4620 4610
ttl reset TtlBotRankA
ttl reset TtlBotRankB
ttl reset TtlBotRankC
# After `ttl reset` (human again): A's wight race no longer makes it a necromancer, so its rank reads 0.
ttl necro test TtlBotRankA reset
ttl necro expect TtlBotRankA rank 0
ttlbot remove TtlBotRankA
ttlbot remove TtlBotRankB
ttlbot remove TtlBotRankC
